\par\plain {What Nietzsche recommends is "total transvalutation of all values". That is, strive to understand your moral system, break it down to its most elemental pieces, the rebuild it into a unique moral system. No one else will be able to understand your new moral system, but its the only way for you to understand your own morals and therefore the only way for you to participate in it fully.}
